


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_9473705f:


    "夕阳下两人的影子，像是要确认对方的存在一般，相拥着融为一体。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_37d113fc:



    voice "RIN_1271"
    rin "「啾……嗯嗯……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_74ef965e:



    voice "FUM_1096"
    fumi "「嗯……呼……嗯……啾噜」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_d6016a1b:


    "双方的唾液交融，发出清亮的水声。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_0d4a12fb:


    "那声音在只有两人的教室里更加明显。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_362727b9:



    voice "RIN_1272"
    rin "「呼……嗯……呼啊……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_979c742e:



    voice "FUM_1097"
    fumi "「哈……嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_7ae5c02e:


    "等快要喘不过气了，才终于把嘴唇拿开。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_93a928bc:


    "依依不舍的舌尖直到最后一刻都连在一起。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_f5a28182:



    voice "RIN_1273"
    rin "「呼啊……好危险好危险」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_811cd88b:


    "伦擦着濡湿的下巴舒了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_88b64efd:



    voice "FUM_1098"
    fumi "「哈……什么危险？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_b2631f03:


    "文也整理好气息问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_ee879dd1:



    voice "RIN_1274"
    rin "「……差点就停不下来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_8a29db69:



    voice "FUM_1099"
    fumi "「那确实很危险呢。特别是今天还没有会议」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_fb99beb1:



    voice "RIN_1275"
    rin "「嗯，要是被阳菜看到这种事情的话……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_071dfbc9:


    "伦缩了缩肩膀。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_53483ef0:



    voice "FUM_1100"
    fumi "「说到夏目同学，昨天晚上真是吓到我了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_d84a9602:



    voice "RIN_1276"
    rin "「是啊。那家伙有时很敏锐……像动物一样」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_8e478a13:



    voice "FUM_1101"
    fumi "「但是，总感觉很抱歉呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_93c42190:



    voice "RIN_1277"
    rin "「我们俩的事情对她保密虽然很内疚，但是现在还没有勇气说出来……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_db75a104:



    voice "FUM_1102"
    fumi "「因为夏目同学，好像对这种事挺严格的」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_5cacb671:



    voice "RIN_1278"
    rin "「确实如此。嘛，如果有个万一只好私奔了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_decde26c:



    voice "FUM_1103"
    fumi "「那是因为……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_ff20c361:


    "文露出了很悲伤的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_20d72344:



    voice "RIN_1279"
    rin "「啊，开玩笑，开玩笑的」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_042f6905:



    voice "FUM_1104"
    fumi "「我们两人的关系当然重要，但是三个人的关系也很重要」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_40464626:



    voice "RIN_1280"
    rin "「我知道的」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_e70cb431:



    voice "RIN_1281"
    rin "「到那时为止都是秘密的幽会啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_5032947c:



    voice "FUM_1105"
    fumi "「是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_50d33356:


    "两人都叹了口气，随后相互微笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_777e4606:



    voice "RIN_1282a"
    rin "「浅生……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_8029dfb6:


    "伦捧住她的脸想再一次吻下去的时候——"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_802f2660:



    voice "HIN_1492"
    hina "「久等了～！」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_9f2e8b6c:



    voice "FUM_1106"
    fumi "「啊哇哇」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_bc0e12d0:



    voice "RIN_1283"
    rin "「真的是，说曹操曹操就到……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_4e587cc5:



    voice "HIN_1493"
    hina "「什么，又说我坏话！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_02_b406b9a7:


    rin_fumi "「不是的不是的」"
